[{:db/id "q-343255/field-1/d97f5278798b73c47edb35c6be4e5ae4a1d896b2ecf7b2da1cb0dd2b3b76d175" :answer/id #uuid "588434b2-7206-5a14-b78b-728d6428c83a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)W(x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343255/field-1/d88ae81244ac6acb6336cafbf39ed227dc1019b6569f8dc508c3ecb2b78660be" :answer/id #uuid "87802a5c-8a88-5935-be4c-a6c289af29d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(3x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x))W(x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343255/field-1/3adc746be663db70bd90d2fbd63806407bb5b4e8c9d3d01f62d7256341291798" :answer/id #uuid "b88d89ce-770a-511c-bc9f-31dd7f812de9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3xW(x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343255/field-1/1683da1dc1c881dd902dd153d0ee1cb580f7d4090b09b74e6621f622f988b7b2" :answer/id #uuid "083d2188-9a75-5a73-820a-67b44f40dc68" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-3x)W(x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343255/field-1/9add9e9fa9df98dbdcbe4e0e2950c7d196744cc84054a83281100bde5f56d8ff" :answer/id #uuid "2d54a241-9400-50be-8fd4-59746463cc8a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-(x+1)W(x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343255/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "bd1afa58-adba-5913-820b-1c6661399dc9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-343255/field-1/1683da1dc1c881dd902dd153d0ee1cb580f7d4090b09b74e6621f622f988b7b2" :answer-field/choices ["q-343255/field-1/d97f5278798b73c47edb35c6be4e5ae4a1d896b2ecf7b2da1cb0dd2b3b76d175" "q-343255/field-1/d88ae81244ac6acb6336cafbf39ed227dc1019b6569f8dc508c3ecb2b78660be" "q-343255/field-1/3adc746be663db70bd90d2fbd63806407bb5b4e8c9d3d01f62d7256341291798" "q-343255/field-1/1683da1dc1c881dd902dd153d0ee1cb580f7d4090b09b74e6621f622f988b7b2" "q-343255/field-1/9add9e9fa9df98dbdcbe4e0e2950c7d196744cc84054a83281100bde5f56d8ff"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343255" :question/id #uuid "1f6435cd-574f-5efd-a976-2c2c34c55725" :question/math-academy-id "q-343255" :question/problem "$$\n{y}^{″}+(3x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)){y}^{′}+(x+1)y=0\n$$\n\nConsider the second-order homogeneous differential equation above. Let ${y}_{1}$ and ${y}_{2}$ be solutions, and let $W(x)$ be their Wronskian. Which differential equation must $W(x)$ satisfy?$\\,$\n${W}^{′}(x)=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Abel's identity says that if ${y}_{1}$ and ${y}_{2}$ are solutions of\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+P(x){y}^{′}+Q(x)y=0,\n$$\n\nthen their Wronskian $W(x)$ satisfies\n\n$$\n{W}^{′}(x)=-P(x)W(x).\n$$\n\nIn our equation, the coefficient of ${y}^{′}$ is \n\n$$\nP(x)=3x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into Abel's identity gives \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{W}^{′}(x) & =(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-3x)W(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-343255/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "357839bc-6cf7-532d-a4cd-ce4b64aefc41"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-343255"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-343264/field-1/81d9f5e6efe94a165ba6e5157dd2ac97d8b00170b9a7a845231f2eb4371a679b" :answer/id #uuid "0e3236bf-bed0-51d4-b1ac-836d0f3a0d10" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{4}W(x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343264/field-1/238325e721060d965a2e050f13fb92a71ee22afe6dccd91526959c8baeadd53c" :answer/id #uuid "bf4b0f91-6c58-56d6-899f-2090b42078ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{x}W(x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343264/field-1/9853ad82e918f7440fe72c1292410c6b1b563fb127d282c8d98a7b6a6aa63e8f" :answer/id #uuid "f99811fe-31d0-5e53-830f-25c34fd00e57" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{2x}W(x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343264/field-1/d1a18d9b8da743f769c29e990a00c47b5df5a2095b29e32382574ab14bbf6359" :answer/id #uuid "9572e7ff-099d-5